Third-party components bundled in the distributed agent JAR
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The OhMyRASP Java agent JAR shades (relocates and embeds) the following
third-party libraries. Their classes are relocated under
`io.ohmyrasp.agent.shaded.*` to avoid conflicting with the instrumented
application's own dependencies, but the original license terms continue to
apply to that code.

  ASM — a Java bytecode manipulation and analysis framework
    Modules:   org.ow2.asm:asm, org.ow2.asm:asm-commons (relocated to
               io.ohmyrasp.agent.shaded.asm)
    Copyright: (c) 2000-2011 INRIA, France Telecom
    License:   BSD-3-Clause
    Home:      https://asm.ow2.io/

    Redistribution and use in source and binary forms, with or without
    modification, are permitted provided that the conditions of the
    BSD-3-Clause license are met. The full license text is available at
    https://asm.ow2.io/license.html

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party services in the control plane and console
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The control-plane API (Go), host daemon (Rust), and web console (TypeScript)
depend on additional open-source libraries that are NOT bundled into the agent
JAR. Their licenses are recorded in the respective dependency manifests
(api/go.mod, daemon/Cargo.toml, console/package.json) and their lockfiles.
